sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Review as PeriodicReviewJob
  participant Ideas as outing_idea
  participant Scout as OutingScoutJob + pure checks
  participant Lead as Lead agent (memories, preferences)
  participant Helper as web_search helper (no private tools)
  participant App as Android app

  Review->>Lead: look over new mail and messages
  Lead->>Ideas: save_outing_idea(what, when, where, with, source id)
  Note over Lead,Ideas: a gig in a newsletter, a friend saying "we should get dinner"

  Scout->>Scout: freeSlots(next 7 days), recentContacts(messaged in last 90 days), weekly budget
  alt no free slot, or budget used
    Note over Scout: stop here, no model call
  else Thursday 18:00 to 22:00 free
    Scout->>Lead: JobDue with slot, saved ideas, recent contacts (compact)
    opt no saved idea fits the slot
      Lead->>Helper: delegate(brief: city, window, interests, kinds liked and declined)
      Note over Helper: searches and reads pages in its own run, kept out of the lead's context
      Helper-->>Lead: up to 3 events (title, time, place, url)
    end
    Lead->>App: send_to_user(kind = look_forward, outing card + sources)
    Note over App: "Thursday evening is free. Jazz at the Blue Room with Sam Example?"
    alt Add to calendar
      App-->>Lead: yes
      Lead->>Lead: create_event, mark idea used
    else Not this time
      App-->>Lead: no
      Lead->>Ideas: mark declined (nothing added, no pause)
    end
    Lead->>Lead: remember what kind of outing it was and the answer
  end
